; Drawn from primitives per this project's standing procedural-drawing rule.
; A small golden slug with a bright white-hot core reads as a fired bullet at
; 1280x720 without needing a new sprite sheet — the revolver ITSELF is shown
; as an item icon (sprite_item_golden_revolver.png, cropped from the founder's
; reference art), but the flying shot is this tiny primitive, same as how the
; smoke bomb and axe are primitives/sprites in flight.
